30:["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"The Miqat."}]," Many pilgrims change into Ihram at the hotel and only pray and make their intention at ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"Abyar Ali"}],"; others change at the mosque, which has large washing and changing facilities. Allow 20–40 minutes, more for a family. Our ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/blog/complete-miqat-locations-guide-umrah-pilgrims","children":"Miqat guide"}]," covers the rules."]}]
